{"channelId":"UCrorKFq5lWRqKYT4eqA7kCg","row":["RanchoMassage",62,"Rancho Cucamonga Massage and Bodywork offers a variety of types of massage to relieve chronic back pain, neck pain, sports injuries and more. \r\nLocated in Rancho Cucamonga we are central to Upland, Fontana, Alta Loma and Claremont. \r\n\r\nEveryone who comes in for a massage gets a free initial exam from a chiropractor to make sure there aren't underlying problems that need to be addressed with the joints and nervous system. \r\n\r\nWe offer deep tissue massage, Swedish massage, sports massage and more. \r\nOur massages are therapeutic and live giving and can greatly improve quality of life.\r\n\r\nCall to schedule an point today and check out out our website for awesome specials and free offers!\r\n\r\nCall 909-948-9611 today. Spots fill up fast!","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrorKFq5lWRqKYT4eqA7kCg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrorKFq5lWRqKYT4eqA7kCg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:50.305Z","channelId":"UCrorKFq5lWRqKYT4eqA7kCg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"7be17d3b3b86ad6b5cf808957c5519eef886f83ad994c583a0299dfa273d8dcf","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"de3607fa7d8720c1828103efb429f2a62ccbbce9f49a9cf6ad5cb7c37494d5bb"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrorKFq5lWRqKYT4eqA7kCg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":62,"raw":"62 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrorKFq5lWRqKYT4eqA7kCg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:50.305Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["massage therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["massage therapist"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vucp7nIwQ7I"]}],"cleanup":{"sta